[{"data":1,"prerenderedAt":110},["ShallowReactive",2],{"news-detail-2026-university-of-michigan-dearborn-scholarship-50-000-award-243":3},{"news":4,"more":27},{"id":5,"slug":6,"title":7,"content":8,"authorName":9,"authorId":10,"status":11,"recommended":12,"datePosted":13,"deadline":14,"images":15,"notifiedAt":14,"notifiedBy":14,"createdAt":13,"updatedAt":21,"categories":22,"readTime":24},243,"2026-university-of-michigan-dearborn-scholarship-50-000-award-243","2026 University Of Michigan-dearborn Scholarship: $50,000 Award","\u003Cp>TheUniversity of Michigan-Dearborn annually offer a $50,000 scholarship award for new incoming international students willing to study in the university.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>University of Michigan-Dearborn Scholarship Abstract\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Scholarship Host: University of Michigan-Dearborn\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Study Abroad: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fcategory\u002Fscholarship\u002F\">Study Abroad\u003C\u002Fa> || \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fcategory\u002Fscholarship\u002Fscholarships-in-usa\u002F\">Study-In-USA\u003C\u002Fa>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Location: United States of America (USA)\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Category: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fcategory\u002Fscholarships\u002F\">Scholarships\u003C\u002Fa> || \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fcategory\u002Fscholarships\u002Fundergraduate-scholarships\u002F\">Undergraduate Scholarships\u003C\u002Fa> \u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Benefits:\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>$50,000 per year\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Eligibility: All Countries\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Deadline: November 15, 2026\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>University of Michigan-Dearborn ScholarshipDetails\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>To prepare international students to pursue higher education internationally despite the complex financial challenges, the University of Michigan–Dearborn has decided to award students the International Undergraduate Scholarships.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>The University of Michigan-Dearborn is a caring, inclusive, student-focused institution which is committed to excellence in teaching, learning, research, and scholarship, as well as access, affordability, and impact.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>University of Michigan-Dearborn Undergraduate Scholarship Benefits\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>The International Undergraduate Scholarship awards an annual scholarship of $12,500.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>It totals an amount of $50,000 over a period of 4 years.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>University of Michigan-Dearborn Scholarship Requirements\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>To be eligible for the undergraduate University of Michigan-Dearborn Scholarship, applicants must satisfy the following conditions:\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Be an international student that holds a valid visa\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Have a GPA of 3.0 and meet the country-specific requirements.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Have a cumulative GPA of 3.0 at UM-Dearborn to renew the scholarship.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Renewable with a cumulative GPA of 3.0 at UM-Dearborn.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Required Documents for University of Michigan-Dearborn Scholarship\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>While applying for the 2026 University of Michigan-Dearborn Undergraduate Scholarship, you will be required to submit the following documents;\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Complete Application Form\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>High School Transcripts\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Personal Statement\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Recommendation Letters\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>SAT\u002FACT Score\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>How To Apply for University of Michigan-Dearborn Scholarship\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>To apply for the University of Michigan-Dearborn Undergraduate Scholarship, follow the instructions we have outlined below; \u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Read the details we have provided on this website\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Click on the button below to visit the \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fumdearborn.edu\u002Ffinancial-aid\u002Ftypes-aid\u002Fscholarships\u002Fundergraduate-international-students\">scholarship webpage\u003C\u002Fa> of the university \u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Apply for an \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fumdearborn.edu\u002Fadmissions\u002Fundergraduate\">undergraduate program\u003C\u002Fa> before the deadline\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>All eligible international students will be considered.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>GPA, at the time of admission, is used in determining scholarship eligibility.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>All scholarships are subject to review for renewal at the end of each academic year.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>APPLY HERE: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fumdearborn.edu\u002Fadmissions-aid\u002Fpaying-college\u002Fnon-resident-first-year-transfer-and-international-scholarships\">https:\u002F\u002Fumdearborn.edu\u002Fadmissions-aid\u002Fpaying-college\u002Fnon-resident-first-year-transfer-and-international-scholarships\u003C\u002Fa>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>","Linkskool",16,"published",0,"2026-05-18 14:19:56",null,[16],{"fileName":17,"oldFileName":17,"type":18,"file":19,"url":20},"assets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002F2026-university-of-michigan-dearborn-scholarship-50-000-award\u002F6a0b11fc6fe372.20738177_screenshot 2026-05-18 141307.png","image","","https:\u002F\u002Flinkskool.com\u002Fassets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002F2026-university-of-michigan-dearborn-scholarship-50-000-award\u002F6a0b11fc6fe372.20738177_screenshot%202026-05-18%20141307.png","2026-06-24 11:55:43",[23],{"id":24,"name":25,"createdAt":26},2,"Opportunities","2026-01-07 13:35:07",[28,38,48,57,66,75,84,93,101],{"id":29,"slug":30,"title":31,"images":32,"datePosted":36,"authorName":37},305,"dartmouth-college-kings-scholarship-usa-2026-fully-funded-opportunity","Dartmouth College Kings Scholarship Usa 2026: Fully Funded Opportunity",[33],{"fileName":34,"oldFileName":34,"type":18,"file":19,"url":35},"assets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fdartmouth-college-kings-scholarship-usa-2026-fully-funded-opportunity\u002F6a3c3537be16a2.95289717_screenshot 2026-06-24 204255.png","https:\u002F\u002Flinkskool.com\u002Fassets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fdartmouth-college-kings-scholarship-usa-2026-fully-funded-opportunity\u002F6a3c3537be16a2.95289717_screenshot%202026-06-24%20204255.png","2026-06-24 20:51:19","LINKSKOOL",{"id":39,"slug":40,"title":41,"images":42,"datePosted":46,"authorName":47},304,"mexican-government-scholarship-for-foreigners-2026-fully-funded-opportunity","Mexican Government Scholarship For Foreigners 2026: Fully Funded Opportunity",[43],{"fileName":44,"oldFileName":44,"type":18,"file":19,"url":45},"assets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fmexican-government-scholarship-for-foreigners-2026-fully-funded-opportunity\u002F6a3c32aaeb8a11.62235495_screenshot 2026-06-24 201924.png","https:\u002F\u002Flinkskool.com\u002Fassets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fmexican-government-scholarship-for-foreigners-2026-fully-funde